{
  "slug": "pr-comments-resolver",
  "name": "Pr Comments Resolver",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "A Claude Code skill plugin that resolves unresolved PR/MR review comments across GitHub and GitLab.\n\nFeatures\n\nMulti-platform: Supports GitHub (Pull Requests) and GitLab (Merge Requests)\nAuto-detection: Identifies the hosting platform from the git remote URL\nCLI verification: Checks that the required CLI tool (gh or glab) is installed and authenticated\nMemory: Saves platform settings so subsequent runs skip detection\nConfigurable verification: Runs project-defined lint, test, and analysis commands from CLAUDE.md\nLanguage-agnostic: Works with any programming language or framework",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, `resolve-comments` (Use when resolving unresolved PR or MR review comments, working through reviewer feedback, or addressing code review threads…).\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install pr-comments-resolver@claude-community` from `Dropelikeit/pr-comments-resolver`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "antigravity",
    "codex"
  ],
